         "multiple": false,
         "typeClass": "primitive",
         "value": "Includes 622 maximalist campaigns that set on from 1900-2019, correcting known coding errors and adding cases that were discovered through further research. Includes outcomes through 2019. Excludes data on violent flanks, peak participation size, regime and campaign support, security force defections, and state violence. These variables are in progress. The list and variables are preliminary and are subject to change with new information. The full NAVCO 1.3 dataset will be released by the end of 2020."
